  "schema_version": 1,
  "note": "G1: geography tags from an article's own title and the first dek_chars of its dek (fetcher/geo.py), so a passing mention deep in a body-length dek does not move a story. terms match case-insensitively on word boundaries, with an optional plural s or es; cased terms match exactly as written (acronyms, surnames). weak and weak_cased terms count only for an article whose source bucket is in weak_buckets: the outlet is a tie-break for a local-only signal, never a signal on its own. strip phrases (outlet names) and each region's exclude phrases are removed before matching. The Middle East is not Asia: it is in world only. Central Asia is not in asia either; Afghanistan is, as South Asia. Congress alone is not a US signal (India's Congress party); us is not read by any tab today.",
